  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: pypdf 6.21.1+rhlw.1",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released pypdf 6.21.1+rhlw.1 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-115585, CVE-2026-115572, and CVE-2026-115580.\n\nCVE-2026-115585: pypdf: Possible long runtimes for repeated malformed cross-reference entries (Follow-up)\n\nCVE-2026-115572: pypdf: Possible long runtimes for repeated references to the same missing object\n\nCVE-2026-115580: pypdf: Possible long runtimes for large xref table header limits\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for pypdf 6.21.1 from PyPI.",
